        "fileName": "Quotemine_Archer_Crew_Voices_zrgFK7N.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-18T16:48:46.309Z",
        "changeLog": "Quotemine — Archer Crew Voices — v1.1\n\n* Retuned the start/end timing on ~60 lines: callouts no longer clip the first word or get cut off at the end, and a few that opened with dead air now fire promptly.\n* Removed two lines that didn't land well in battle.\n* No new events or content — same hookups as v1.0. Just drop in the new .wotmod and delete the old one."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "updated",
      "source": "wgmods",
      "sourceId": "7740",
      "title": "Garage Progress Bar",
      "previous": {
        "modVersion": "1.1.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.1.0",
        "fileName": "GarageProgressBar_1.1.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-15T23:29:31.570Z",
        "changeLog": "New \"Ignore Free XP\" option (off by default) — count only the combat XP earned on each vehicle toward its progress instead of your account's spendable Free XP. When on, the fill, per-item affordability, tooltips and the battles estimate all reflect combat XP only, and the bar shows the Combat-XP icon. Toggle it in the Modification list window (ModsSettingsAPI)."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "1.2.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.1.0",
        "fileName": "GarageProgressBar-Bundle_1.2.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-18T16:45:55.827Z",
        "changeLog": "New \"Scale\" setting (Default / Large). Choose Large to render the bar wider with bigger text and icons — easier to read at a glance. Default keeps the current size.\nMoved to Aslain's ModsSettingsAPI and now bundles the ModsList API dependency.\nLarger, clearer tooltips — description text and icons are bigger and more legible."
      }
    },
